      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ohh I see what you mean. I think such configurations do not exist. \n\nIf there was `linker_config` with `vendor: true` and with `installable: true`, this soong module would create a installation rule to `$TARGET_OUT/vendor/etc/linker.config.pb`. Such a file would collide with the existing `$TARGET_OUT/vendor/etc/linker.config.pb` created by kati packaging system [2]\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/linkerconfig/linkerconfig.go;l\u003d88?q\u003d%5C%22linker_config%5C%22%20f:build%2Fsoong\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main\n\n[2] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/make/core/Makefile;l\u003d3928?q\u003dlinker.config.pb%20f:build%2Fmake\u0026ct\u003dos\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main",
